OL,3,GNEWSAHospice charity opens shop to
OL,4,Aserve community
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Guernsey charity has opened a new
OL,7,Fretail premises, despite growing
OL,8,Fpressures on brick and mortor stores.
OL,10,FLes Bourgs Hospice opened the new
OL,11,Fcharity shop in Guernsey at Oatlands
OL,12,Fvillage on Wednesday.
OL,14,FCeo of the Hospice, Rob Jones, said:
OL,15,F"Our ethos has always been we've wanted
OL,16,Fto provide something for families and
OL,17,Fchildren... and when I saw the outland
OL,18,Fsite come up I thought 'that's
OL,19,Fperfect'."
